Domain Entity RestraintEvent
    documentation 'This event entity represents the instances where a special education student was 
                  'physically or mechanically restrained due to imminent serious physical harm to 
                  'themselves or others, imminent serious property destruction or a combination of 
                  'both imminent serious physical harm to themselves or others and imminent serious 
                  'property destruction.
    string RestraintEventIdentifier
        documentation 'A unique number or alphanumeric code assigned to a restraint event by a school, 
                      'school system, state, or other agency or entity.
        is part of identity
        min length 1
        max length 20
    date EventDate
        documentation 'Month, day, and year of the RestraintEvent.
        is part of identity
    enumeration EducationalEnvironment
        documentation 'The setting where the RestraintEvent was exercised.
        is optional
    enumeration RestraintEventReason
        documentation 'A categorization of the circumstances or reason for the RestraintEvent.
        is optional collection
    reference Student
        documentation 'Reference to student that was restrained.
        is part of identity
    reference Program
        documentation 'The special education program associated with the RestraintEvent.
        is optional collection
    reference School
        documentation 'The school where the RestraintEvent occurred.
        is part of identity